AWK is a text processing language, and this makes it perfect for generating
Text Pattern QuickScripts from AWK Templates in less than 25 lines of code.

Here are some examples of creating Text Pattern QuickScripts using AWK:

$ awk -f tpl-0001.awk > 00_20260514_163527.txt

$ awk -f tpl-0002.awk > 00_20260514_163804.txt


